rmed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3621286629","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113385#issuecomment-3621286629","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113385","id":3621286629,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7X2HLl","user":{"login":"aaronjyoder","id":45483768,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDgzNzY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45483768?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronjyoder","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronjyoder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronjyoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronjyoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronjyoder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronjyoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronjyoder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronjyoder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronjyoder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronjyoder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronjyoder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-06T22:10:29Z","updated_at":"2025-12-06T22:37:57Z","body":"Changes:\r\n- Added tests for this PR as well as [#103214](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103214) (tab separation)\r\n- Renamed `TAB_SIZING_CONTENT_WIDTH` to `TAB_SIZING_FIT_CONTENT`.\r\n- Moved code around a bit to make snippets appear consistently and where you would expect them based on the UI.\r\n- Fixed above noted issue regarding minimum width.\r\n- Fixed another bug where uniformly-sized tabs would exceed the tab bar width when a max tab size was set.\r\n- Cached tab width to prevent unnecessary calls to `get_tab_width`.\r\n- Reordered Uniform sizing to be the 2nd option (below Fit Content) instead of the last option. This was done so that related sizing strategies (Fit Content/Uniform, and Justify/Expand) are located near each other, which feels a bit more intuitive.\r\n   - To elaborate a little more: Fit Content and Uniform both do not attempt to expand to the full tab bar width, whereas Justify and Expand do. You could argue that Fit Content/Justify and Expand/Uniform are related in the sense that the former base their widths on the content, and the latter increase their widths equally, but at least in my own testing it felt better to sort the options based on how they interact with the full width of the tab bar.\r\n- Updated documentation based on above feedback.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3621286629/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4049188498","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113385#issuecomment-4049188498","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113385","id":4049188498,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7xWbaS","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-12T18:50:29Z","updated_at":"2026-03-12T18:50:29Z","body":"> Note: I ignore the side margin for the Justify and Expand modes since it felt more correct based on what those sizing modes do. If you'd like different functionality there, let me know.\r\n\r\nI feel like those should be respected. If the user wants for the tabs to fully expand, them they can simply remove those margins.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4049188498/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4164557838","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113385#issuecomment-4164557838","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113385","id":4164557838,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74OhwO","user":{"login":"Araraura","id":25017422,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDE3NDIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25017422?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Araraura","html_url":"https://github.com/Araraura","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Araraura/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Araraura/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Araraura/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Araraura/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Araraura/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Araraura/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Araraura/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ara